It starts from Sniffnet commit ab4bf739d464 (2026-10-20, after Sniffnet v1.5.1).
Sniffnet's desktop interface, charts, sounds, fonts, icons, translations,
built-in MaxMind GeoLite2 databases and project files were removed; the browser interface, the window program, the
packet store, the dissectors, the display filter, the TCP analysis and the
statistics are new. CHANGELOG.md describes the changes.

